# screcord

This repo is **screcord**: a zero-dependency Swift CLI screen recorder (ScreenCaptureKit + AVFoundation).

## Skills (read when relevant)

- Recording / demos / which display: [.cursor/skills/screcord/SKILL.md](../skills/screcord/SKILL.md)
- Changing code / features / build: [.cursor/skills/screcord-dev/SKILL.md](../skills/screcord-dev/SKILL.md)

## Defaults

- Build with `make build` (not bare `swift build`)
- Keep zero third-party Swift packages
- Separate audio writer inputs for system vs microphone
- Update CLI help + README + skills when UX changes
